# BOOST CHAIN (custom): stun a pack of ENEMY 2s and boost from one to the next.
training 0xF0000001 "BOOST CHAIN"
menu "BOOST CHAIN" "custom"
clip boost_chain.hdclip

step "-A pack of ENEMY 2s. Damage them to STUN them."                    until scuttles_stun >= 3
step "-DASH or JUMP in to a STUNNED enemy to BOOST off it."              until scuttles_boost >= 3
step "-Chain BOOSTS from enemy to enemy without touching the ground."
step "-Keep the pack STUNNED and BOOST through all of them."             until scuttles_boost >= 10 when playing

keep 3 scuttles every 0.5
